# Manufacturer partOf ParentCompany relationships
mfr:Audi ex:partOf company:Volkswagen%20Group .
mfr:BMW ex:partOf company:BMW%20Group .
mfr:Mercedes-Benz ex:partOf company:Mercedes-Benz%20Group .
